# Rendered audio is large and reconstructible: a record carries render_sha256
# and render_bytes, so a re-render can be verified bit-for-bit without the
# original being stored here.
runs/*/renders/
*.wav
*.flac
*.aiff
*.aif
*.mp3

# Everything else in a run — manifest, candidate records, failure records,
# hashes, feature data, summary — IS committed. Losing it is the failure this
# directory exists to prevent, so do not add a blanket ignore here.
